## Deferred / Not Worth Pursuing (2026-07-18)

### Phase 3: n_exec=1 IR Round-Trip Shortcut — DEFERRED

**Problem:** When the splitter determines nothing to split, the query still goes through the full IR→SQL round-trip (~3.5ms overhead per query).

**Why deferred:** Only applies to 1 DSB query (node-based) and 2 DSB queries (topdown). Total savings ~3.5-7ms on DSB, 0ms on JOB. Negligible.

**Location:** ir_query_splitter.cpp lines 871-874 (no-split early exit) vs lines 1286-1484 (regenerated SQL path).

### Phase 4 Remaining: Non-Inner Join Split — DEFERRED

